// The parser handles §2's expressions and nothing else yet, so a file is one
// expression. `hello.glue` is statements and will not parse until §3 lands.
//
// Colour runs by nesting depth, cycling every six levels; the underline
// alternates token by token so neighbours at one depth stay apart. The shape
// on screen is the shape of the tree — change a `*` to a `+` and watch the
// grouping move.
f(a + b * c, d.e[0] as u64, (g || h) && !i)
